    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/2a44c34d867d521a9fbae6e497b7bfc5.poster.avif?t=1754467567\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/2a44c34d867d521a9fbae6e497b7bfc5.webm?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/2a44c34d867d521a9fbae6e497b7bfc5.mp4?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Standards and Do as You\u2019re Taught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bow your head. Curl your tail. Smile when it hurts. You\u2019ll follow rules so twisted they gnaw at your mind. Every choice is a gamble, every success a nail in the coffin of your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/4463812d26a1e6a4763b0cea6f57240a.poster.avif?t=1754467567\" width=420 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/4463812d26a1e6a4763b0cea6f57240a.webm?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/4463812d26a1e6a4763b0cea6f57240a.mp4?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats With Standards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven hidden object descent into madness. Non-stress gameplay which still\u00a0claw through the sinister truth of a world that demands you to obey. The darker the rules, the darker the secrets\u2014and the more you\u2019ll wonder if you ever belonged at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones. Yes, bones. Find them to continue. They don\u2019t belong to the cats, but they obey anyway. A society so warped, even their appetites aren\u2019t their own. Each hidden fragment adds to the grotesque mosaic of your crumbling reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/eec8f6cf694ebf3e23fcc9f508ca6674.poster.avif?t=1754467567\" width=418 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/eec8f6cf694ebf3e23fcc9f508ca6674.webm?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/eec8f6cf694ebf3e23fcc9f508ca6674.mp4?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dystopian nightmare dripping in fur and fangs. Find yourself laughing when you're supposed to cry. The original soundtrack gnaws at your mind, dragging you deeper into a world where the laughter feels wrong, and silence is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel of fractured choices and splintered realities. Every decision shifts your fate, weaving a web of endings that tighten around you. Choose carefully\u2014rebellion might hurt, but obedience will destroy you completely.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/2a44c34d867d521a9fbae6e497b7bfc5.poster.avif?t=1754467567\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/2a44c34d867d521a9fbae6e497b7bfc5.webm?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/2a44c34d867d521a9fbae6e497b7bfc5.mp4?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Standards and Do as You\u2019re Taught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bow your head. Curl your tail. Smile when it hurts. You\u2019ll follow rules so twisted they gnaw at your mind. Every choice is a gamble, every success a nail in the coffin of your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/4463812d26a1e6a4763b0cea6f57240a.poster.avif?t=1754467567\" width=420 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/4463812d26a1e6a4763b0cea6f57240a.webm?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/4463812d26a1e6a4763b0cea6f57240a.mp4?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats With Standards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven hidden object descent into madness. Non-stress gameplay which still\u00a0claw through the sinister truth of a world that demands you to obey. The darker the rules, the darker the secrets\u2014and the more you\u2019ll wonder if you ever belonged at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Object</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones. Yes, bones. Find them to continue. They don\u2019t belong to the cats, but they obey anyway. A society so warped, even their appetites aren\u2019t their own. Each hidden fragment adds to the grotesque mosaic of your crumbling reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/eec8f6cf694ebf3e23fcc9f508ca6674.poster.avif?t=1754467567\" width=418 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/eec8f6cf694ebf3e23fcc9f508ca6674.webm?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320020/extras/eec8f6cf694ebf3e23fcc9f508ca6674.mp4?t=1754467567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dystopian nightmare dripping in fur and fangs. Find yourself laughing when you're supposed to cry. The original soundtrack gnaws at your mind, dragging you deeper into a world where the laughter feels wrong, and silence is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel of fractured choices and splintered realities. Every decision shifts your fate, weaving a web of endings that tighten around you. Choose carefully\u2014rebellion might hurt, but obedience will destroy you completely.</p>",
